      "description": {
        "fun": "Shellos looks different depending on which side of Sinnoh's Mount Coronet it lives: pink in the West Sea, blue-green in the East Sea. Squeeze its squishy body and a sticky purple fluid oozes out, thought to be a kind of stress sweat, and it's a pain to wash off. Its ancestors had shells, hence the name, and Game Freak first meant it for Ruby and Sapphire.",
